# DME101.030 — Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator
library "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage".

/*
Prior-authorization coverage model for ultrasonic osteogenesis stimulators.
`first:` makes the branches ordered (first match wins): the three exclusions are
tested before the approval branch so a denial wins by position, and `otherwise`
is the catch-all (deny). See docs/decision-shapes.md.

Per the PA authoring approach:
- the four conditions are local case-features, each carrying its own LOCAL domain
  `code is` (no value sets / `coded from`, no terminology — source-representation
  expansion is a later phase);
- the dispositions are the shareable `Approve` / `Deny` determination activities.
*/

// ============ Concepts (local case-features) ============

concept "Fracture Of Skull Or Vertebrae":
- type is Condition.
- code is `skull-or-vertebrae-fracture`.

concept "Tumor-Related Fracture":
- type is Condition.
- code is `tumor-related-fracture`.

concept "Concurrent Noninvasive Stimulator In Use":
- type is Device.
- code is `concurrent-noninvasive-stimulator`.

concept "Documented Fracture Nonunion":
- type is Condition.
- code is `documented-fracture-nonunion`.

// ============ Decision ============

decision "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage":
first:
- when "Fracture Of Skull Or Vertebrae" then recommend activity "Deny".
- when "Tumor-Related Fracture" then recommend activity "Deny".
- when "Concurrent Noninvasive Stimulator In Use" then recommend activity "Deny".
- when "Documented Fracture Nonunion" then recommend activity "Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Deny".

// ============ Activities (shareable PA determinations) ============

activity "Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Prior authorization request approved.`.

activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Prior authorization request denied.`.
